OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Faffecting Norfolk and Suffolk will
OL,7,Fsoon clear, leaving a dry and cold
OL,8,Fnight for most. Light winds and clear
OL,9,Fskies will allow a widespread frost to
OL,10,Fdevelop, with patches of freezing mist
OL,11,Fand fog forming.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA crisp and clear morning,
OL,14,Fany freezing fog will slowly clear. A
OL,15,Fbright and sunny afternoon to follow,
OL,16,Fwith light winds. Feeling cool, with
OL,17,Ftemperatures remaining in the single
OL,18,Fdigits.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
